      <h2 class="CH"><a name="7.05"></a>CHAPTER 7-05<br />SMOKE-FREE AND TOBACCO-FREE AIR</h2>
            <p class="digCH">SECTIONS:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0001">7-05-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DEFINITIONS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0002">7-05-001-0002</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;APPLICATION OF ORDINANCE TO CITY-OWNED FACILITIES</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0003">7-05-001-0003</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PROHIBITION OF SMOKING AND USE OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTES IN PUBLIC PLACES</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0004">7-05-001-0004</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PROHIBITION OF SMOKING AND USE OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTES IN PLACES OF EMPLOYMENT</p>

