            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0007">7-05-001-0007</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DECLARATION OF ESTABLISHMENT AS NONSMOKING AND FREE FROM USE OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTES</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0008">7-05-001-0008</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;POSTING OF SIGNS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0705000.html#7.05.001.0009">7-05-001-0009</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;NONRETALIATION</p>

